      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Blit 1.0.5. The rename presets now work on names with spaces, underscores or hyphens between words, not only dots: "Some Show S01E02 Episode Title 1080p….mkv" becomes "Some-Show_S01E02.mkv", and the episode is written in capitals. Presets you haven't edited are updated once; edited ones are left as they are.</p>]]></description>
